          <span class="rsb-split__eyebrow">Our Story</span>
          <h2>18+ Years of Acoustic Innovation</h2>
          <div class="rsb-divider"></div>
          <p>Founded in 2006, Yukings has grown from a small workshop to one of China's leading noise barrier manufacturers. Our journey has been marked by continuous innovation, quality excellence, and customer-centric service.</p>
          <p>Today, we operate a 42,000 m² vertically-integrated factory with state-of-the-art production lines including CNC perforation, powder coating, hot-dip galvanizing, and acoustic testing facilities.</p>
          <ul class="rsb-split__list"><li>Established in 2006 in Shenzhen, China</li><li>42,000 m² purpose-built manufacturing facility</li><li>18+ years of OEM/ODM experience</li><li>Exporting to 60+ countries worldwide</li><li>109+ noise barrier related patents</li><li>ISO/IEC 17025 accredited acoustic lab</li></ul>
          <div class="rsb-split__actions"><a href="/contact/#inquiry" class="rsb-btn rsb-btn--primary">Contact Us</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rsb-section__head" style="margin-top:60px">
        <h2>Our Timeline</h2>
        <div class="rsb-divider rsb-divider--center"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rsb-timeline">
        <div class="rsb-timeline__item"><span class="rsb-timeline__year">2006</span><h3 class="rsb-timeline__title">Company Founded</h3><p class="rsb-timeline__text">Yukings established in Shenzhen, China with initial focus on galvanized steel noise barriers.</p></div>
        <div class="rsb-timeline__item"><span class="rsb-timeline__year">2010</span><h3 class="rsb-timeline__title">CE Certification</h3><p class="rsb-timeline__text">First products certified to EN 1793/EN 1794 standards, opening European markets.</p></div>
        <div class="rsb-timeline__item"><span class="rsb-timeline__year">2014</span><h3 class="rsb-timeline__title">New Factory</h3><p class="rsb-timeline__text">Moved to 42,000 m² purpose-built facility with automated production lines.</p></div>
        <div class="rsb-timeline__item"><span class="rsb-timeline__year">2018</span><h3 class="rsb-timeline__title">Acoustic Lab</h3><p class="rsb-timeline__text">ISO/IEC 17025 accredited acoustic testing laboratory established.</p></div>
        <div class="rsb-timeline__item"><span class="rsb-timeline__year">2020</span><h3 class="rsb-timeline__title">Solar Barriers</h3><p class="rsb-timeline__text">Launched PV-integrated solar noise barrier product line.</p></div>
